> Why should[ you Lam]inate your Hardwood Floors?[
]The lamination is done by a synthetic product which is applied in various layers. it is designed to shine the outer surface of hardwood. Hardwood floors are like[ lam]inated floors but different. Because the two terms are used interchangeably, it is important to know the pros and cons of both types of flooring so that you can choose what works best with you. If[ you] want you to want to convert your hardwood floors into[ lam]inate wood flooring, know the following facts about both types of floor.
