=== Text #1 ===
> On the 12th Day of[ Christmas] my[ true] love gave to me, twelve Drummers Drumming.
I just want you to think about it for a minute people. In the name of interesting gift giving, this poor lady[ now] has girls milking cows[, others] dancing[ around her courtyard].[ She has a small band] of pip[ers and drum]mers. Oh,[ and] let's[ not] forget[ the band] of leaping lords.[ She] is overrun by all kinds of fowl[ including] geese[,] partridges[,] turtle doves[,] swans and hens. But its not all bad.[ She has] managed to get[ a] bit of jewelry out of the whole thing. I guess she could[ have] done worse.[ She] could[ have] gotten[ a box] of chocolates and the dude[ could have] called it quits.[ He certainly] gets an A for creativity if nothing else.
[Over here] in our little Fig[ Tree] neck of the[ woods, we are] a bit tired and[ certainly] dazed by all of your shopping prowess. You guyss are quite a[ dedicated] bunch and we really appreciate you!
For this last day we have a grab bag of little goodies. All those little items that we didn't manage to share on any other day. We have: LITTLE BAG O' PEARL BUTTONS, TWINE, CHARMS, POT HOLDERS & a few new BUNDLES.
And the LAST free goodie for our 12 Days is our CHRISTMAS ROSE STOCKING pattern. A perfect little addition to this time of year!
For ordering info on the goodies above, CLICK HERE.
Can't believe that the 12 DAYS OF CHRIST[MAS] SALE[ is] done! It has been so much fun to do this with you and such a fun Christmas tradition to do for the second year.
Tune in tomorrow for a special follow up post!
I know that[ we] just barely made it[ without having to] call it CHRISTMAS IN AUGUST... which just doesn't quite have the same ring to it, don't you think?
But it's still July, so maybe you could just go with it with me?
